  (text "BEHAVIOUR\nE-stop open or K2 energised -> safety relay drops -> K1 de-energised (VMOT off) + STO_A/STO_B low.\nReset needed after release (Y1/Y2). K1 aux contact feeds MOTOR_PWR_ON_N for software status only.\nMissing: EDM feedback wiring, contact ratings, certified relay selection." (at 15.24 174.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1dce424f-db8e-5e12-9696-9d46093be88b"))
